{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0xhc3QlMjBIb2xpZGF5JTIwJTI4MjAwNiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Last Holiday","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2SkM1AHIgCQgdOboER6euPKTxGF.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7D1v3y0RPoyJBZAx4eGdjcqJUuD.jpg","description":"The discovery that she has a terminal illness prompts introverted department store saleswoman Georgia Byrd to reflect on what she realizes has been an overly cautious life. With weeks to live, she withdraws her life savings, sells all her possessions and jets off to Europe where she lives it up at a posh hotel. Upbeat and passionate, Georgia charms everybody she meets, including renowned Chef Didier. The only one missing from her new life is her longtime crush Sean Williams.","releaseInfo":"2006","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.3","runtime":"112 min","cast":["Queen Latifah","LL Cool J","Timothy Hutton","Giancarlo Esposito","Alicia Witt","Gérard Depardieu","Jane Adams","Michel Estime"],"director":["Wayne Wang"],"released":"2006-01-13T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"She always thought she was somebody special... and she was.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Queen Latifah","character":"Georgia Byrd","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zKJ0fZ7ne57fTWWd3WP1OVvoLS6.jpg"},{"name":"LL Cool J","character":"Sean Williams","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dpOHjasRJz7rk9CVutd6L9WnWTc.jpg"},{"name":"Timothy Hutton","character":"Matthew Kragen","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oWVtWGEauBs0zXrk0cWqiqYxJtN.jpg"},{"name":"Giancarlo Esposito","character":"Senator Dillings","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/MJOo4QZgMAb3y8QzOUDVFQusQZ.jpg"},{"name":"Alicia Witt","character":"Ms. Burns","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vQ2McAjHjY3A7oDrPMx6aLSsvkW.jpg"},{"name":"Gérard Depardieu","character":"Chef Didier","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pOpHfkYRhFJiKAiIycdguQPYfem.jpg"},{"name":"Ja